<title>FRANCE: Cetelem reports 16 pct rise in 96 loans.</title>
<headline>Cetelem reports 16 pct rise in 96 loans.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cetelem loan activity for 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in billion French francs unless stated).</p>
<p>    Total consumer loans		   49.0   +16 pct.</p>
<p>    - of which in France		   46.5   +14 pct.</p>
<p>    - of which in Europe		    2.5   +55 pct.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>NOTE - In a statement Cetelem, a unit of Compagnie Bancaire, said total credit volume managed by Cetelem and its subsidiaries at end 1996 stood at 72.1 billion francs, up 11 percent over December 31, 1995.</p>
</text>
